{
  "id": "skill_hs_searchqa_constraint_check_target_gepa_20261024",
  "goal": "Verify exact quotes and flag visible word or letter constraints without grading semantic correctness.",
  "guidance": "Check a concrete candidate, exact source quote, or stated length issue. Bind output constraint_check to the same-named optional solve input. Flags are advisory: a length phrase may describe an anchor, and a valid alias may be absent from the text. Revise only the affected claim; never invent a hidden grading result.",
